# The foundation needs no environment variables and makes no provider calls.
# Never put a Nano-GPT key in a VITE_* variable: those values enter the client bundle.
# Service configuration will be added with task P2 and documented alongside its implementation.

# Nano-GPT MCP (Cursor / Claude Code) only. Official server: npx -y @nanogpt/mcp
# Required by https://docs.nano-gpt.com/integrations/mcp — get a key at https://nano-gpt.com/api
# This does not replace the personal service credential vault. Do not commit a real key.
# Optional MCP vars: NANOGPT_TIMEOUT_MS, NANOGPT_DEFAULT_MODEL, NANOGPT_LOG_LEVEL,
# NANOGPT_BASE_URL (default https://nano-gpt.com), NANOGPT_AUTH_MODE, NANOGPT_MAX_RETRIES
NANOGPT_API_KEY=
